{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: read \"integrel\" as \"integral\"\n  ucas: it(x) = x^2\n  ucas: integrate it\n∫ x^2 dx\n  = x^3/3 + C\n  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 1.4e-14)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "the integrel of x squared", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x) = x^2", "integrate it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "integrate", "var": "x", "integrand": "x^2", "antiderivative": "x^3/3"}]}, "notes": [{"kind": "info", "text": "read \"integrel\" as \"integral\""}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "derivative", "points": 401, "max_diff": 1.4210854715202004e-14, "passed": true, "text": "d/dx of the antiderivative against the integrand"}], "files": [], "text": "  note: read \"integrel\" as \"integral\"\n  ucas: it(x) = x^2\n  ucas: integrate it\n∫ x^2 dx\n  = x^3/3 + C\n  check: d/dx of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 1.4e-14)\n"}, "isError": false}}
