{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: read \"gradiant\" as \"gradient\"\n  ucas: it(x, y) = x^2 + y^2\n  ucas: grad it\n∇ it = (2x, 2y)\n  ∂/∂x it = 2x\n  ∂/∂y it = 2y\n  holds wherever the formulas are defined\n  check: every entry matches central differences at 200 points (max relative difference 4e-13)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "the gradiant of x^2+y^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x, y) = x^2 + y^2", "grad it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "grad", "gradient": [{"var": "x", "derivative": "2x"}, {"var": "y", "derivative": "2y"}]}]}, "notes": [{"kind": "info", "text": "read \"gradiant\" as \"gradient\""}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 200, "max_diff": 3.9970424744006895e-13, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: read \"gradiant\" as \"gradient\"\n  ucas: it(x, y) = x^2 + y^2\n  ucas: grad it\n∇ it = (2x, 2y)\n  ∂/∂x it = 2x\n  ∂/∂y it = 2y\n  holds wherever the formulas are defined\n  check: every entry matches central differences at 200 points (max relative difference 4e-13)\n"}, "isError": false}}
